From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:40:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] AROS: normalize native volume prefixes before automation root
 checks

Use the SDK -nix path contract proven by main/worker path probes. Convert volume-prefixed inputs to Unix absolute paths before joining with a root; retain parent components and reject ambiguous volume syntax. All 15 platform host tests pass; native rooted MCP remains to be rerun.
